27T21:28:26Z"},"body":"Here's a bunch of code adding some Vulkan raytracing stuff to the rendering device: \r\n- Vulkan implementations in `RenderingDeviceDriverVulkan`\r\n- Raytracing instruction list in `RenderingDeviceGraph`\r\n- Functions to create acceleration structures and raytracing pipelines in `RenderingDevice`\r\n\r\nThere's more in the [fahien/raytracing-test](https://github.com/Fahien/godot/tree/fahien/raytracing-test) branch, with code handling raygen, miss, and closest-hit shaders, but it's a hack on top of the forward clustered renderer, and it needs some \"guided\" refactoring.\r\n\r\nHere's a sample which uses GDScript to drive the renderer: [raytracing-gdscript-demo](https://github.com/Fahien/godot-raytracing-gdscript-demo)\r\n\r\nI hope this changes would look useful to jump-start raytracing support.\r\n\r\nRelevant for https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/5162","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99119/reactions","total_count":200,"+1":83,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":45,"co